    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cozy mushroom foraging Simulation, that teaches you how to identify 15 different types of mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get to manage your own little Shop, that you inherited from your grandma. Here you may sell all the edible mushrooms you found during the day. And spend that hard earned money on new pages in your mushroom guide, basket upgrades or a lantern to see better in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learn about 15 beginner friendly mushrooms<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/efd6b9a7c35ed79b8fadd3b57f148a87.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell mushrooms to the townsfolk<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/3d86a7dbfb9d341df873ed657ac17230.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore a big map inspired by European forests<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/eef0fc805967da125093d067342eb65c.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a cozy mushroom foraging Simulation, that teaches you how to identify 15 different types of mushrooms!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also get to manage your own little Shop, that you inherited from your grandma. Here you may sell all the edible mushrooms you found during the day. And spend that hard earned money on new pages in your mushroom guide, basket upgrades or a lantern to see better in the dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >learn about 15 beginner friendly mushrooms<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/efd6b9a7c35ed79b8fadd3b57f148a87.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell mushrooms to the townsfolk<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/3d86a7dbfb9d341df873ed657ac17230.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >explore a big map inspired by European forests<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3769520/extras/eef0fc805967da125093d067342eb65c.avif?t=1754060243\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p></li></ul>",
